# Chapter 5's GIF: Opening the stats tab: table, sparkline, bars, and gauge.
# Regenerate with:  python3 tools/scripts/record_media.py gifs --only 5

Output Sources/TerminalUI/TerminalUI.docc/Resources/demo-ch5.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 760
Set Height 460
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type ".build-recordings/tutorial/.build/release/tasks50301"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "3"
Sleep 2.5s

Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms
